		(property "Description" "Richtek RT6160AWSC 3 A I2C buck-boost, WL-CSP-15B 1.4x2.3 mm, 0.4 mm pitch, 0.6 mm max. Ball map identical to the U902 land (A1 EN, A2/A3 VIN, B1 VSEL, B2/B3 LX1, C1 AGND, C2/C3 PGND, D1 SCL, D2/D3 LX2, E1 SDA, E2/E3 VOUT). VSEL high: 3.45 V at power-up (VOUT2 reset 0x39); firmware writes 0x05 = 0x33 for 3.3 V (V = 2.025 V + code x 25 mV). I2C 0x75, IQ 2 uA typ, ILIM_P 4.5-5.5 A."
